CONFLUENT_CLOUD_API_KEY=<YOUR-API-KEY>
CONFLUENT_CLOUD_API_SECRET=<YOUR-API-SECRET>
# Service Accounts on Azure with OIDC:
# If you run the python code on Azure with a system-managed identity, you do not need to set these variables.
# If you are using a service account (App Registration) as the technical user who is used to query
# the Confluent Cloud Service Quota API (this is NOT the App Registration which represents Confuent
# Cloud your tenant) on Azure but without a system-managed identity, set the following environment variables:
# NOTE: The AZURE_CLIENT_ID is the Object ID of the Enterprise Application which belongs to the App Registration.
# It is NOT the App Registration ID.
#AZURE_TENANT_ID=
#AZURE_CLIENT_ID=
#AZURE_CLIENT_SECRET=
